tests/golden/check/fixedbugs-135-an-escape-by-a-character-s-code.hero:21:13: error[unknown_escape]: `\x41` is not an escape sequence — a string holds its characters as themselves, and writes by its code only a control character, a bidirectional control, U+2028 or U+2029, as `\u{1b}`; write `\\` for a literal backslash
